Z||000000||BENGAL4||11-06-2001||10:29 PM||||I was on my way home from work today, and 2 Mustang GT's get right on my tail on a 4 lane highway. 1 was a 5.0 and the other a 4.6. The 5.0 jumps over into the left lane and gets right beside me, We are going about 60 mph and he's reving it up. I look over at him and nod and we both downshift and floor it. I jump about a car and a half ahead of him and he can't catch me. <P>I slow down and he looks like a deer staring into headlights. He cant believe he was spanked by a Fiero. After that, the 4.6 wanted no part of it. Too bad. I was ready to give him a can of whoop a$$ too. fun fun fun.<P>Bill<BR>86Gt<BR>3800 II S/C ||||reg||10
