Z||000015||Butter||11-07-2001||11:31 AM||||Yall,<BR>Give ole' BlackStang95 a break.  I'll bet he's still in his car infantcy.  I used to own one of them Ford Cobra type Mustang thinges' then I grew up, got wise and sold it to get a real car, a Fiero.  Or as some would put it, traded a Pony for a Horse!<P>Got tired of pushin'a pony, pushin'a pony, pushin'a pony.  Sometimes I meet some of those people doin' that pushin'a pony thing and they must be tired too cause now in my Fiero I wind up Pullin' a Pony, Pullin' a Pony, Pullin' a Pony!  I've pulled so many ponys I think my Fiero has hemroids.  Reckin' I'm gonna have to get a trailor hitch put on my fiero cause it's gotten tired of spitting those ponys out the ashaust, I mean exhaust.<P>I think the only reason Ford is "First On Race Day" is so they can get there the day before and "Fix Or Repair the car that Day" so they can race.  They don't wont it "Found On Raceday Dead".<P>Sometimes the child in me just gots to come out.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Guess I better shut up before my Ranchero gets mad at me. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> That's that "Freakin' Ole' Run Down" truck I use to get my Fiero should it get the four T's, "Too Tired To Travel". <BR> ||||reg||12
